 326:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/lv_math.c ****      * within +/- 1 degree of the accurate value without needing
 327:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/lv_math.c ****      * large slow trig functions like ArcTan() or ArcCos().
 328:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/lv_math.c ****      * NOTE! at least one of the X or Y values must be non-zero!
 329:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/lv_math.c ****      * This is the full version, for all 4 quadrants and will generate
 330:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/lv_math.c ****      * the angle in integer degrees from 0-360.
 331:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/lv_math.c ****      * Any values of X and Y are usable including negative values provided
